<section class="seoFaqs">
<h2 class="seoFaqs__title">Preguntas frecuentes sobre True Hearts Duo</h2>
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage" class="seoFaqsAccordion">
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity"
itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__item app-storefront-seofaqs-list-item">
<button class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeader" type="button">
<span itemprop="name"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderTitle">¿Cuánto cuesta el servicio de música para la boda en True Hearts Duo?</span>
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__angleDown seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderIcon"   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/angleDown.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                    </button>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemContent ">
En True Hearts Duo se puede contratar la música para la boda desde 750€ hasta 1.500€.                                                    </div>
</div>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity"
itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__item app-storefront-seofaqs-list-item">
<button class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeader" type="button">
<span itemprop="name"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderTitle">¿Qué servicios musicales para la boda ofrece True Hearts Duo?</span>
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__angleDown seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderIcon"   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/angleDown.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                    </button>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemContent ">
True Hearts Duo hará que la fiesta se convierta en un recuerdo único para los invitados con servicios musicales como:                                                             <ul class="seoFaqs__list">
<li class="seoFaqs__itemList">
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__checkLight "   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/checkLight.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                                            Música para el cóctel/banquete                                        </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity"
itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__item app-storefront-seofaqs-list-item">
<button class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeader" type="button">
<span itemprop="name"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderTitle">¿En qué estilo musical es especialista True Hearts Duo?</span>
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__angleDown seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderIcon"   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/angleDown.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                    </button>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemContent ">
Para ambientar la ceremonia, el cóctel o la fiesta de la boda True Hearts Duo está especializado en música:                                                             <ul class="seoFaqs__list">
<li class="seoFaqs__itemList">
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__checkLight "   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/checkLight.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                                            Chill out                                        </li>
<li class="seoFaqs__itemList">
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__checkLight "   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/checkLight.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                                            Jazz                                        </li>
<li class="seoFaqs__itemList">
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__checkLight "   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/checkLight.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                                            Electrónica                                        </li>
<li class="seoFaqs__itemList">
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__checkLight "   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/checkLight.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                                            Pop                                        </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity"
itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__item app-storefront-seofaqs-list-item">
<button class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeader" type="button">
<span itemprop="name"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderTitle">¿Qué tipo de formación musical conforma True Hearts Duo?</span>
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__angleDown seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderIcon"   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/angleDown.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                    </button>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemContent ">
Con True Hearts Duo se puede disfrutar de un amplio repertorio a cargo de estas formaciones musicales:                                                             <ul class="seoFaqs__list">
<li class="seoFaqs__itemList">
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__checkLight "   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/checkLight.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                                            Dueto                                        </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity"
itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__item app-storefront-seofaqs-list-item">
<button class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeader" type="button">
<span itemprop="name"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderTitle">¿Cuántos miembros componen True Hearts Duo?</span>
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__angleDown seoFaqsAccordion__itemHeaderIcon"   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/angleDown.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                    </button>
<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
<div itemprop="text"
class="seoFaqsAccordion__itemContent ">
La formación musical de True Hearts Duo es:                                                             <ul class="seoFaqs__list">
<li class="seoFaqs__itemList">
<i class="svgIcon app-svg-async svgIcon__checkLight "   data-svg="https://cdn1.bodas.net/assets/svg/optimized/_common/checkLight.svg" data-svg-lazyload="1"></i>                                            Pequeña (2-3 músicos)                                        </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>
